# Vendored maven artifacts are checksum-validated byte-for-byte. Git's automatic
# line-ending conversion (core.autocrlf=true, the Windows default) rewrites the
# .pom and maven-metadata.xml files on checkout, which breaks their recorded
# .md5/.sha1 and makes dependency resolution fail with
# "Failed to read artifact descriptor". Keep this tree byte-exact.
repo/** -text

# Shell scripts must keep LF so they stay runnable from containers and CI.
*.sh text eol=lf
